  "notes": "Tall sage-grey residential apartment tower. Two flat-roofed vertical masses over the OBB: a wider lighter sage block (#95a49a, left/main, ~62% width) with recessed balconies and dark windows, and a narrower cooler blue-grey block (#6f7d80, east/right) with lighter grey-blue window strips. Camera is a low street-level angle so the top is cut off -- 8 floors modelled as a faithful tall residential block. Front facade shows a regular window grid with white/light frames; main block has recessed balconies (terraces entry, dark metal bar rail #3f4744) and a ground-floor entrance. Frontage: grey masonry retaining wall (#8c8f88) topped by a clipped green hedge (verge grass #5c8a3a) with a metal railing behind (not separately expressible), grey stone-slab sidewalk, asphalt road with parked cars and palms/trees (props omitted per no-environment rule). Colours pixel-sampled by eye from the scene-fullworld ref 2026-07-04."
